	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n_H7d6g0bqRs0T-Bg",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 14, DX 11, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 14, WILL 7, PER 8, FP 12, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 7, DODGE 8, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxF5zi29stgiYbIuH",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 19 (offense 12, protection 7), threat tier minor, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4obxy9cuxcqwvd1b",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/boar.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n4406Mc0n87Oqdv9X",
			"text": "Independent build total: -40 points of racial traits plus 2 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nEqRxER4LwPI7DIm9",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Boar (SRD 5.1); Boar (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nF42_gHnb6blEUkbN",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6uPZxOrbIlpT7513",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5, 7 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkT950EzypI2OfHJi",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUIbk08XMEnMZxNkq",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
